From 499609a2a1503ea7fef404e5b72fbb2e9fa2a9f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunrisepeak <speakshen@163.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 05:10:11 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] perf(clangd): qualified completion filters guides and exact
 operator names

External namespace completion still materialized deduction guides and operator
overloads that could not match the typed query. Match guide template names and
operator completion spellings before loading their declarations, preserving
unknown names, ordinary lookup, all overloads and partial external storage.
Use the actual Sema typed spelling, including operatorco_await.

Tests compare external and textual completion names, signatures and edits,
and preserve omitted ordinary lookups and selected overload sets.
